{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24503","headline":"残春晚起伴客笑谈 · 白居易","name":"残春晚起伴客笑谈","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掩户下帘朝睡足，一声黄鸟报残春。\n披衣岸帻日高起，两角青衣扶老身。\n策杖强行过里巷，引杯闲酌伴亲宾。\n莫言病後妨谈笑，犹恐多於不病人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}